#!/bin/sh
# Campus maps and the four functional buildings, third version: real campus detail, isometric. Run: sh scripts/art/campus3.sh
cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.." || exit 1
ISO="True isometric projection throughout (2:1 dimetric: ground lines at 26.57 degrees, verticals vertical), the look of a polished isometric city-builder game. Flat vector shading with three tones per surface (lit side, shaded side, roof), crisp edges, soft ground shadows at one consistent angle, no black outlines."
CAMP="This is a rich, lovingly detailed university campus, not a diagram: academic buildings with real architecture (brick or stone walls with rows of mullioned windows, cornices, entrance porticos with steps, pitched or flat roofs with chimneys, skylights and roof units), a quad with crossing paved paths, benches, lamp posts, bike racks, hedges, flower beds, a variety of trees (round, tall, flowering) with shadows, a sports court, a small amphitheatre, picnic tables, a bus stop on the edge street, a few tiny simplified people walking and sitting (no faces). Colour: buildings in warm brick red, sandstone and cream with slate or copper-green roofs; lawns in two soft greens; paths in pale stone. Keep scenery slightly softer in saturation than a toy, because four special buildings will be placed on top later and must stand out. Leave FOUR clear empty building plots, each an isometric diamond of pale paving 260 wide and 130 tall with a darker edging and a short path connecting it to the quad, centred exactly at (340,330), (1260,330), (340,650), (1260,650); draw nothing on the plots. viewBox 0 0 1600 900; fill the entire canvas to every edge with campus (lawn, streets, buildings cropped by the edges); no sky, no empty margins."
BLD="One isometric building as a large game-map object on a transparent background, viewBox 0 0 480 480, the building's footprint centred near (240,330) on a small paved isometric base, soft ground shadow. It must look like a real university building, recognisable to a student at a glance, with careful architecture: brick or stone walls with rows of windows, a clear main entrance with steps, roof details. Richer colour and more detail than ordinary background buildings, with a bright accent roof or awning so it reads as a place you can enter."
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs campus3-nyu "Draw an isometric campus map for a downtown New York university neighbourhood. In the centre (around 800,480) the landmark: a city park square with a white marble triumphal arch, a large round fountain with water, radiating paths and autumn trees. Around it a dense urban campus: brownstone rows with stoops, a tall red sandstone library block, a glass student centre, brick academic halls, tree-lined streets with crosswalks, violet banners on lamp posts. $CAMP $ISO" high &
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs campus3-columbia "Draw an isometric campus map for a classical uptown New York university. In the centre (around 800,440) the landmark: a domed neoclassical library with a colonnade and very wide stone steps with a seated bronze statue, facing a long lawn with crossing brick paths and a second colonnaded library at the far end. Around it symmetrical red-brick halls with copper-green roofs and limestone trim, iron gates, hedged walks, light blue banners on lamp posts. $CAMP $ISO" high &
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs bld2-library "Draw a university LIBRARY: a stately three-storey stone and brick building with tall arched reading-room windows through which bookshelves and green lamps can be seen, a columned entrance with wide steps, a small clock or lantern cupola, a book-drop box, bicycles parked at a rack, a banner with an open-book symbol. Accent roof colour: deep teal. $BLD $ISO" high &
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs bld2-clubs "Draw a university STUDENT ACTIVITIES CENTER where clubs meet: a lively modern brick-and-glass building with a double-height glass lobby, a row of club tables outside under small canopies, a notice wall of blank colourful flyers, pennant strings, a small outdoor stage with speakers, a bike and a guitar case leaning by the door. Accent canopy colour: coral red. $BLD $ISO" high &
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs bld2-commons "Draw a university STUDENT COMMONS and dining hall, the place to meet people: a warm brick hall with large windows showing long tables inside, a terrace with round tables, chairs and umbrellas, string lights, a coffee cart, planters, a few tiny simplified students sitting together (no faces). Accent umbrella and awning colour: sunny yellow. $BLD $ISO" high &
node scripts/art/neon-svg.mjs bld2-career "Draw a university CAREER AND OPPORTUNITIES CENTER: a smart contemporary building of brick, wood and glass with a welcoming entrance canopy, an outdoor notice kiosk with blank cards, a wall with a compass-and-arrow emblem, a small interview-room window with two chairs, a flagpole with a plain pennant. Accent roof colour: royal blue. $BLD $ISO" high &
wait
